//< A function longer than the 300-line guideline must be reported
//<
//< If the guideline is written down and the detection does not work, the guideline is not kept.
//< This file holds one deliberately long function. It is excluded by name from the size check in
//< tests/suite/conventions_test.kspls (remove the exclusion and it fails on itself).
// EXPECT: [H0803] This function spans
